{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104140552278-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104144544\"/><p>救援人員趕至現場。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>長沙灣有人墮樓。今午(4日)1時44分，一名年約50歲男子從蘇屋邨百合樓一低層單位墮下，受傷倒臥大廈平台位置。救援人員接報到場將清醒事主救回地面，交救護車送院治理，其身份及墮樓原因有待調查。據悉，事主居住4樓一單位，事發時正在檢拾物件意外墮樓。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:47.209776+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:05:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.118541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:52.035473+00:00","content_hash":"992e7db9f03291109bb9ac97b18a8cb5ec5dc6caf4d5d02ca9779a1bd16e3316","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:47.209776+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}